# SOFTWARE SERVICE AGREEMENT

**Contract ID:** TEST-002

**Parties:** ABC Technologies (Service Provider) and XYZ Solutions (Customer)

## 1. Payment Terms
The customer shall pay the service provider ₹50,000 per month. Payment is due within 15 days of receiving the invoice.

## 2. Service Availability
The service provider will make reasonable efforts to keep the software service available to the customer.

## 3. Data Handling
The service provider may process customer data to provide the agreed software services.

## 4. Confidentiality
Both parties agree to use reasonable care when handling confidential information.

## 5. Termination
Either party may terminate this agreement by providing 15 days' written notice.

## 6. Liability
The agreement does not specify a liability cap or detailed liability exclusions.

## 7. Security Incident Notification
The agreement does not specify a deadline for notifying the customer about a security incident.

## 8. Governing Law
The parties will determine the applicable governing law in writing if a dispute arises.